{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n$23件!酥脆撻皮+香滑吉士蛋漿\n</p>\n<h2>SOFT THUNDER全新香蕉拖肥蛋撻！</h2>\n<p>人氣烘焙店SOFT THUNDER 中環新店將於 11 月 6 日正式開幕，新店帶來近日大熱的香蕉拖肥批以蛋撻的方式呈現，勢必再掀全城熱話！全新「香蕉拖肥蛋撻」($23) 每日中午 12 時限量出爐，售完即止，底層吉士蛋漿糅合香蕉、意大利朱古力及咖啡風味，配以新鮮香蕉及焦糖，頂層蓋以法國忌廉並撒上朱古力粉。酥脆撻皮加上絲滑忌廉與香甜果肉，好邪惡！</p>\n<h2>中環店限定提拉米蘇雲朵拿鐵</h2>\n<p>中環店亦新推「提拉米蘇雲朵拿鐵」($43)，面層豐盈濃厚的奶蓋，採用100%馬斯卡彭芝士 (Mascarpone) 製作，口感細膩，充滿提拉米蘇的軟滑口感。除此之外，店內備有多款自家工房每日新鮮出爐的麵包及蛋糕，包括熟客喜愛的「香蕉蛋糕」($25)，各款輕食三文治當中不乏有趣的選擇，像「豬柳蛋班戟三文治」($36)、「加拿大烤肉漢堡」($36) 等，必定可揀選到心頭好。</p>\n<p>SOFT THUNDER 中環店<br/>\n地址：中環德輔道中 68 號萬宜大廈商場一樓 106 – 107 號舖<br/>\n營業時間： 星期一至五 7:30am – 7:30pm、星期六及日 8am – 7:30pm<br/>\n官方IG：@soft.thunder.bakery</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368562283018787_12117581736ae978778fd16.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368562283018787_12117581736ae978778fd16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368562617137331_3925115286ae9787a67760.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368562617137331_3925115286ae9787a67760.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368562813179442_1833136916ae9787c5f53c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368562813179442_1833136916ae9787c5f53c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936856296354575_4867847316ae9787ddd2bc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17936856296354575_4867847316ae9787ddd2bc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368563130224822_13705897106ae9787f7f6e1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368563130224822_13705897106ae9787f7f6e1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368563278718813_15708293916ae978813843b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368563278718813_15708293916ae978813843b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368563462786230_19130126646ae97882cf51b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179368563462786230_19130126646ae97882cf51b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：新假期編輯部)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfQ63cjgamE/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:22:46.282547+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":786,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback